From e68c3e4d2174f52a0af2b6bec29b26324fcf02a5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: fi3 <you@example.com>
Date: Wed, 24 Jun 2026 14:12:25 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] ADD vim visual selection for yanking terminal pane text

Command-mode visual selection lets terminal users copy rendered text from either pane with familiar vim motions. The terminal adapter bridges yanked text to OSC52 while the harness records the same copy notice for automated coverage.
